WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.622
OSINT is disciplined intelligence work using lawfully accessible public information.

00:00:04.622 --> 00:00:08.692
Raw data and collected facts are not automatically intelligence.

00:00:08.692 --> 00:00:13.214
Intelligence answers a defined question through organized collection, source evaluation,

00:00:13.214 --> 00:00:15.022
analysis, validation, and reporting.

00:00:15.022 --> 00:00:18.640
Begin with a clear requirement and permitted scope.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.710
Select source categories that fit the question, preserve provenance,

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.327
and stop collecting when the need is met.

00:00:26.327 --> 00:00:31.301
Search engines, websites, records, news, technical data, repositories, social sources, imagery,

00:00:31.301 --> 00:00:34.014
and maps all require context-specific evaluation.

00:00:34.014 --> 00:00:37.180
Corroborate important claims through genuinely independent evidence.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:41.250
Examine origin, timeliness, bias, access, expertise, and manipulation risk.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:45.319
Distinguish direct observations from source claims and analytical judgments,

00:00:45.319 --> 00:00:48.937
and communicate confidence without pretending uncertainty has disappeared.

00:00:48.937 --> 00:00:52.102
Document methods, URLs, timestamps, preserved artifacts, transformations,

00:00:52.102 --> 00:00:55.720
and reasoning so the work can be reviewed.

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.337
Apply privacy, proportionality, access limits, and retention discipline.

00:00:59.337 --> 00:01:03.859
Public visibility never excuses harassment, doxxing, stalking, deception, unauthorized access,

00:01:03.859 --> 00:01:05.216
or unlawful surveillance.

00:01:05.216 --> 00:01:08.381
The goal is not to collect everything.

00:01:08.381 --> 00:01:13.807
The goal is to answer an important question responsibly and provide useful

00:01:13.807 --> 00:01:16.068
intelligence to an authorized audience.

00:01:16.068 --> 00:01:20.138
Strong OSINT is careful about evidence, honest about limitations,

00:01:20.138 --> 00:01:24.660
and focused on decisions that are ethical, lawful, and defensible.
